# Task 28 watchdog test, 2026-10-20 05:25: STALL 30000 stops ControlTask's heartbeat; MonitorTask stops feeding the timer-group-0 watchdog (MWDT0) once ControlTask has been silent for 5 s; MWDT0 resets the chip 10 s later (rst:0x7 TG0WDT_SYS_RST) and the next boot reports the watchdog reset. SchedulerTask's 1 s lines show the rest of the system kept running until the reset. Excerpt of the console capture; Wi-Fi, broker and shim lines left out.
